  "theorem_statement": "The CXLVII observable grammar can be implemented as an exact rational tagger.  The known mixer constants 8/13, 5/13, 3/13, 10/13, 16/13, 24/13, 15/13, and 9/13 are all classified by base, imbalance, complement, plus-branch, or q-lift operations.  Nearby fractions such as 7/13, 11/13, 12/13, and 13/7 are not automatically promoted without an additional grammar operation.",
